#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:13
msgid "Electro Permanent Magnet v3 (EPMv3)"
msgstr "电永磁体 v3（EPMv3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:13
msgid "Electro Permanent Magnet v1 (EPM688)"
msgstr "电永磁体 v1（EPM688）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:13
msgid "Servo Gripper"
msgstr "舵机夹爪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:5
#: 4fb20860d012436fb5de0c7dd95f1554
msgid "Grippers (for delivery)"
msgstr "夹爪（用于投递）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:7
#: 77039f88ea364591b1ea2b110b15c0de
msgid ""
"Copter supports a number of different grippers which can be useful for "
"delivery applications and bottle drops."
msgstr "Copter 支持多种夹爪，可用于投递应用和瓶子投放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:9
#: e1729e80d3bd47d689b9af5aa90c3af4
msgid ""
"Follow the links below (or in sidebar) for configuration information based "
"upon your set-up."
msgstr "请点击以下链接（或侧边栏）根据您的配置获取相应的设置信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:21
#: 41798553fe6a46288db09b6c1f7ea36c
msgid ""
"Grippers can be configured to release in a failsafe situation using "
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` (ArduCopter only)"
msgstr "可使用 :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 将夹爪配置为在失控保护情况下释放（仅 ArduCopter）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:24
#: 68953b128cf245fb9347321bf3534efb
msgid "Common Gripper Parameters"
msgstr "通用夹爪参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:26
#: e8293a1eb4fd4c1aab5c66f2023f5dff
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_ENABLE<GRIP_ENABLE>`: Enables use of gripper and shows following "
"parameters."
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_ENABLE<GRIP_ENABLE>`：启用夹爪并显示以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:27
#: 3fe07cef4a9e45ebb4b9a820aae72ad4
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_TYPE<GRIP_TYPE>`: Type of gripper - 0:None(disables without "
"hiddening parameters), 1:Servo, 2:EMP"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_TYPE<GRIP_TYPE>`：夹爪类型 — 0:无（禁用但不隐藏参数），1:舵机，2:电永磁体"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:28
#: 6c4e373de0b0495b94dd21b3f886313a
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_AUTOCLOSE<GRIP_AUTOCLOSE>`: Time in secs (0 disables) to re-grip "
"payload after releasing. Used for payload replacement after delivery."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GRIP_AUTOCLOSE<GRIP_AUTOCLOSE>`：释放后重新抓取载荷的时间（秒，0 表示禁用）。用于投递后的载荷更换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:29
#: 74ea4d7a4dc24cce896f960a909a22c9
msgid ":ref:`GRIP_GRAB<GRIP_GRAB>`: PWM in uS to grab payload"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_GRAB<GRIP_GRAB>`：抓取载荷的 PWM 值（微秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:30
#: fdb9b30dc2154b0b85ddc11ce84e8e1e
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_NEUTRAL<GRIP_NEUTRAL>`: PWM in uS to neither grab nor release "
"payload"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_NEUTRAL<GRIP_NEUTRAL>`：既不抓取也不释放载荷的 PWM 值（微秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:31
#: 0f31109c09cc437b9d6dbfd92b4a0aa3
msgid ":ref:`GRIP_RELEASE<GRIP_RELEASE>`: PWM in uS to release payload"
msgstr ":ref:`GRIP_RELEASE<GRIP_RELEASE>`：释放载荷的 PWM 值（微秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:32
#: 3e4145d4e08948eba61b0ae5a15179a2
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_REGRAB<GRIP_REGRAB>`: (EMP only) Time interval in seconds (0 "
"disables) to regrab payload to assure EM hold has not decayed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GRIP_REGRAB<GRIP_REGRAB>`：（仅电永磁体）重新抓取载荷的时间间隔（秒，0 表示禁用），用于确保电磁保持力未衰减。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:33
#: 8c1bdbd7a5d94615926ab2fb04502bb4
msgid ""
":ref:`GRIP_CAN_ID<GRIP_CAN_ID>`: (EMP only) Refer to "
"https://docs.zubax.com/opengrab_epm_v3#UAVCAN_interface"
msgstr ""
":ref:`GRIP_CAN_ID<GRIP_CAN_ID>`：（仅电永磁体）请参阅 "
"https://docs.zubax.com/opengrab_epm_v3#UAVCAN_interface"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:35
#: 5b9831dbb44b4e02aad4987c34d02627
msgid ""
"The autopilot output channel which is attached to the gripper is selected by"
" setting its ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = \"28\"(Gripper)."
msgstr "连接夹爪的飞控输出通道通过将其 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设置为「28」（夹爪）来选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gripper-landingpage.rst:37
#: 15fe8d9b360f486eb853b42363d40c08
msgid ""
"The gripper is controlled by using the MAVLink Command "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GRIPPER <mav_cmd_do_gripper>` or, configuring and RC "
"channel switch to ``RCx_OPTION`` = \"19\" (Gripper)."
msgstr ""
"夹爪通过 MAVLink 命令 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GRIPPER <mav_cmd_do_gripper>` 控制，或将 RC "
"通道拨杆配置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 「19」（夹爪）进行控制。"
